			"notes": "# Changelog\n - Hide the bar separation markers if the super ability isn't available\n - Measure velocity over time rather than instantly when flying, and avoid updating velocity when not required to avoid messing with bat ponies ability to stay hanging\n - Oats can now generate in villages\n - Fixed bat hanging and fix some head position jankiness\n - Fixed crafting recipes for magic staffs and the meadowbrook's staff\n - Fixed Dispel Evil using the wrong format for its range tooltip attribute #601\n - Decreased the cost for casting Dispel Evil to 100 mana (from 1000 mana)\n - The arcane protection now uses the generocity trait for changing to a location based spell. Fixes #597 @LotusCookie"
		},
