			"notes": "This update changes a few things for pegasi. Since the way it calculates velocity on the server is _different_ (as in, I have to calculate it because players don't normally have velocity on the server as of a few mc versions ago >.>) a minor side-effect of that is some things that were probably increased to compensate for it (like running into walls) may become super common.\n\nI've also added a config to revert the behaviour in case any one is encountering issues. In the server section of the config, you would set `disableExperimentalServerVelocityFix` to `true` to revert it back to how flight worked before.\n\n**If everything goes well, this will be the last update before I switch focus to getting the mod ported to 1.21.10/11 and above.**\n\n# Changelog\n - Changed how super ability charge is displayed in the HUD. It now has its own bar with separation from the mana so it's easier to tell what is going on\n - Fixed pegasus flight not functioning correctly in multiplayer\n - Fixed pegasi not able to charge their sonic rainbooms\n - Fixed several other aspects of flight that wasn't working quite as intended"
		},
